"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 532,
"char_end": 545,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 32.1,
"end": 35.1,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And that connects to what we are discussing today.",
"char_start": 546,
"char_end": 596,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 35.1,
"end": 40.56,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I'd like to point something out – Stefan Brandt mentioned a similar dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 611,
"char_end": 706,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 210.0,
"end": 211.86,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Can you give me a specific example?",
"char_start": 707,
"char_end": 742,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 211.92,
"end": 215.1,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 743,
"char_end": 792,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 215.1,
"end": 222.06,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "To be honest, speed comes from braking earlier and more smoothly, not from taking greater risks.",
"char_start": 807,
"char_end": 903,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 222.12,
"end": 225.3,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use RockShox.",
"char_start": 904,
"char_end": 949,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 225.36,
"end": 229.08,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "I've observed this pattern in three different teams.",
"char_start": 950,
"char_end": 1002,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 229.08,
"end": 230.52,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 1017,
"char_end": 1050,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 230.58,
"end": 233.76,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 1051,
"char_end": 1100,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 233.76,
"end": 234.06,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Certainly.",
"char_start": 1115,
"char_end": 1125,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 234.12,
"end": 239.64,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Tire pressure and the choice of tire casing often matter more than a small adjustment to the suspension.",
"char_start": 1126,
"char_end": 1230,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 239.7,
"end": 243.84,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The context is important because it tells you what compromises you are making.",
"char_start": 1231,
"char_end": 1309,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 243.84,
"end": 244.86,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Let's start there.",
"char_start": 1324,
"char_end": 1342,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 244.92,
"end": 248.1,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where do soil erosion and enduro races intersect?",
"char_start": 1343,
"char_end": 1392,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 248.1,
"end": 255.84,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "To be honest, risk management in racing isn't about avoiding crashes; it's about choosing which crashes you can survive.",
"char_start": 1407,
"char_end": 1527,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 255.9,
"end": 259.02,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "We've seen this with teams that use Shimano.",
"char_start": 1528,
"char_end": 1572,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 259.08,
"end": 263.4,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll have to rebuild it from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 1573,
"char_end": 1645,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 263.4,
"end": 264.9,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Where does it break down?",
"char_start": 1660,
"char_end": 1685,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 264.9,
"end": 269.28,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "The Cascadia Alliance is one of the platforms where this is clearly visible.",
"char_start": 1700,
"char_end": 1776,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 269.34,
"end": 273.6,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that most people overlook.",
"char_start": 1777,
"char_end": 1843,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 273.6,
"end": 276.72,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "What is the heuristic (or guiding principle) that you always come back to?",
"char_start": 1858,
"char_end": 1932,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 276.78,
"end": 279.18,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "How does Spoke & Wrench fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1933,
"char_end": 1979,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 279.18,
"end": 280.14,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1994,
"char_end": 2014,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 280.2,
"end": 285.84,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Erosion patterns on the track sections change the line choices between training and race day.",
"char_start": 2015,
"char_end": 2108,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 285.9,
"end": 290.82,
"speaker_label": "Lena Hofmann",
"text": "Once you understand that, the other decisions will become easier.",
"char_start": 2109,
"char_end": 2174,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 290.82,
"end": 296.82,
"speaker_label": "Katrin Vogel",
"text": "Before we continue, please support this podcast and visit the website of our sponsor.",
"char_start": 2189,
"char_end": 2274,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s01"
},
{
"start": 296.88,
"end": 298.98,
